{
  "name": "Summarize daily Reddit and TikTok brand mentions to Slack with Juicer and OpenAI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily social digest in Slack\nFor marketers and founders who want a two-minute morning read on what people say about their brand or topic, without opening every network.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every morning the Juicer node searches Reddit and TikTok for your keyword in one call.\n2. A Code step keeps posts from the last 2 days that really mention it.\n3. An OpenAI model writes a short digest: the main themes, the mood and the 3 posts worth reading.\n4. The digest is posted to Slack.\n\n### Setup\nAbout 10 minutes.\n\n1. Add your Juicer API key (Developer page in Juicer) to **Search Reddit and TikTok**.\n2. Set your keyword and Slack channel in **Your settings**.\n3. Connect OpenAI and Slack.\n4. Click **Execute workflow** to test, then activate it.\n\nEach run spends Juicer API credits per platform (Reddit 1, TikTok 3).\n\n### Requirements\n- A Juicer account with an API key\n- OpenAI and Slack accounts\n\n### Customization tips\n- Add X, Instagram, YouTube or LinkedIn. For those, use a #hashtag with Term Type Hashtag.\n- Change the hour in **Every morning**.\n\nThis template uses the verified Juicer community node (n8n-nodes-juicer). On self-hosted n8n, install it first under Settings > Community nodes.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "6e65c310-86b6-5b39-9e23-63b6c9477bcb",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Find posts\nSet your keyword, search the networks and keep fresh posts that mention it.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 860,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b0ae010a-fea0-5d7e-af2e-01e38d67470d",
      "name": "Find posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Summarize and share\nCombine the posts, let the AI write the digest and send it to Slack.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b789d836-8032-56c5-b76e-5daf58893523",
      "name": "Summarize and share",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "96887b5f-e97e-5454-84dd-4058dab19dac",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -140,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "keyword",
              "name": "keyword",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_BRAND",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "slack_channel",
              "name": "slack_channel",
              "value": "#REPLACE_WITH_CHANNEL",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1291d359-8eae-5b81-8ec3-b0241bf2155c",
      "name": "Your settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        40,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7740a72d-9615-5ff5-afbe-f56c159e8a61",
      "name": "Search Reddit and TikTok",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-juicer.juicer",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "socialData",
        "operation": "searchPosts",
        "term": "={{ $json.keyword }}",
        "platforms": [
          "Reddit",
          "TikTok"
        ],
        "termType": "mentions",
        "limit": 25
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "b68c9014-847c-59d2-b127-7c97c220d416",
      "name": "Keep recent on-topic posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Keep posts from the last 2 days that actually mention the keyword.\nconst keyword = $('Your settings').first().json.keyword;\nconst since = Date.now() - 2 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n\nreturn $input.all().filter(item =>\n  (item.json.message || '').toLowerCase().includes(keyword.toLowerCase()) &&\n  new Date(item.json.post_created_at).getTime() >= since,\n);"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ff80fc62-09db-591f-98cf-d8ec1bc0dc43",
      "name": "Combine posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "posts",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7da6d531-2bff-5240-844e-131111629881",
      "name": "Write the digest",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        940,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a social media analyst. Below are recent social posts about our topic as JSON. Write a short Slack digest: 3 to 5 themes people talk about, the overall mood, and the 3 posts most worth reading with their links. Use Slack formatting: *bold* with single asterisks, plain lists, no headings and no tables.\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.posts.map(post => ({ platform: post.platform, author: post.poster?.name, text: (post.message || '').slice(0, 400), url: post.url, likes: post.like_count }))) }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0caa2b38-e2f9-5daa-9265-52f82b4d280a",
      "name": "OpenAI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "04c1cd50-2ecf-5885-b0f7-86881dc14b72",
      "name": "Post the digest to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1260,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Your settings').first().json.slack_channel }}"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    }
  ],
